# Kiki-Jiki has haste, so it taps the turn it arrives (CR 702.10, 302.6), and makes a token copy of Bot1's Llanowar Elves
# "except it has haste" (CR 707.2, 707.9b): the token taps for {G} at once. "Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step" is
# a delayed triggered ability (CR 603.7): at the end step of turn 3 the token is sacrificed and, a token, ceases to exist
# (CR 111.7); nothing waits after it.

